<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-UIS H1 net up 37 pct to S$6.8 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UIS H1 net up 37 pct to S$6.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.80  vs  4.95</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    4.89  vs  3.56</p>
<p>    Turnover				 8.82  vs  7.71</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	1.32  vs  1.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 8.33  vs  5.95</p>
<p>    Tax					1.54  vs  1.00</p>
<p>Note - United International Securities Ltd is a unit of United Overseas Bank Ltd</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
